/mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> preserves\ninclusion, intersections, and joins of projective subspaces.</p>","file":"ch22-geometry/07-projective-transformations.html"}